                "Adipate-Hurst AH-5 simulated KA oxidizer OX-2 shows 0.58 mass-fraction oxidate "
                "under the 0.74 densitometer trip and a 164 C jacket well below 188 C. The 4.2 t/h "
                "air already in the loop is therefore legal; treating the jacket as a climb echo "
                "would have parked a healthy oxidation.",